        "code": {
          "text": "Scalp and facial skin findings"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Brief examination of face and scalp only: multiple erythematous, rough, scaly macules/papules, 3–8 mm, over vertex scalp, frontal scalp, temples, and upper forehead, consistent with actinic keratoses. No obvious ulceration, induration, or horn lesions. Marked background solar damage. Examination was not a full skin check."
      }
