          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports longstanding sunspots on scalp and face, rough scaly spots for ages, mildly itchy, with no bleeding, ulceration, or rapid change. Reports usual GP freezes them and last cryotherapy was approximately 12 months ago. No known history of melanoma."
